<!DOCTYPE suzuki [
<!ENTITY % sdatacharaents SYSTEM "..\config8\sdatacharaents.txt">
%sdatacharaents;
]>
<suzuki><manual>
<section sectnbr = "3A">
<servcat sctnbr = "03" scnbr = "01">
<configtype typenbr = "1">
<servinfotype sitcode = "6">
<servinfo servinfosgmlid = "AENLSB0A3116006" svcinfotypenbr = "08" svcinfoqualnbr = "03" page = "2" supplyoff = "1" modify = "0">
<title>
Front Wheel Bearing Check
</title>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Hoist vehicle and remove front wheel. 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLSB0A2406001"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Remove front brake disc. 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLSB0A4206005"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Check thrust play of front wheel bearing as follows.
</ptxt>
<ptxt>
If measured value exceeds the limit, replace front wheel hub assembly.
</ptxt>
<s2>
<ptxt>
Apply measuring tip of dial gauge to flat-surface of front wheel hub assembly.
</ptxt>
<attention3>
<ptxt>
Apply measuring tip of dial gauge perpendicular to flat-surface of front wheel hub assembly as much as possible.
</ptxt>
</attention3>
</s2>
<s2>
<ptxt>
Gripping hub at the top and bottom, apply push pull force to the front wheel hub assembly.
</ptxt>
<spec-sdm>
<sdm-title>
Front wheel bearing thrust play
</sdm-title>
<sdm1>
<sdm-condition>
Limit
</sdm-condition>
<sdm-value>
0.05 mm (0.002 in.)
</sdm-value>
</sdm1>
</spec-sdm>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname = "ILSB0A311008.swf" width = "88.000mm" height = "71.590mm" ver = "01" gw = "184" gh = "186"/>
</figure>
</s2>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Install front brake disc. 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLSB0A4206005"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Install front wheel. 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLSB0A2406001"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Check wheel bearing for rattle by shaking wheel in axial direction, and for noise and smooth rotation by turning wheel.
</ptxt>
<ptxt>
If check result is not OK, replace front wheel hub assembly. 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLSB0A3116007"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname = "ILSB0A311009.swf" width = "88.000mm" height = "53.244mm" ver = "01" gw = "163" gh = "134"/>
</figure>
</s1>
</servinfo>
</servinfotype>
</configtype>
</servcat>
</section></manual></suzuki>
